  "notes": [
    "TITLE WITHHELD: the published title 'Do you like pie  How about Poontang Pie' is a sexual joke; 'Brandon Gravo DS' is already taken (post of 4 May 2000), so the page is Brandon Gravo Tatooine Mains And Toys DS (from the description 'Tatooine M+T').",
    "Total 60 as published (headers 8/17/4/5/13/10, plus Bubo and the two lightsabers listed after the Effects without a header).",
    "No Objective. The strategy says 'You start with the Wastes and use CR to pull the Palace', so Tatooine: Jundland Wastes is the starting card and Combat Readiness the starting Interrupt.",
    "Several card lines are joke names, dested from the strategy and the cards' roles: 'Jabba's Pad' Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'Jabba's Bondage Chamber' Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber ('pull the chamber which lets you snag an alien'); a crude nickname for Jabba (withheld) Jabba The Hutt; 'Brangus The Drunken Gambler' Brangus Glee; 'Elephant Man' Ephant Mon; 'Choke Vader' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; '4-LOM w/magic rocket' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Dannik Jerriko the Soup Nazi' Dannik Jerriko; 'IG-88 w/Tazer' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Dengar in JM 5000' Dengar In Punishing One (a JumpMaster 5000); 'Bossk In Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Jade's Blade' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Vader's Blade' Vader's Lightsaber.",
    "'Grabber' matches no card in the April 2000 pool (Allegations Of Corruption is a Coruscant card): kept as posted (UNKNOWN).",
    "Secret Plans, Oppressive Enforcement and Come Here You Big Coward are the Special Edition Effects; Battle Order the Endor Effect (April 2000; Defensive Shields came later). 'Cantina' dested Tatooine: Cantina."
  ],
